window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The first time I met Venture's latest team, I was a nobody, but it only took one crazy stunt to change my life and turn my idols into enemies…</b></p> <p>Five years later, I'm at the top of my game, competing with the best of the best. My stunts are bigger and better, so much so that even Venture's golden boys have begun to take notice.</p> <p>When we are all offered the same contract to find a legendary island, we must vie to be the first to the finish line. The jungle, however, can't be controlled or predicted, and when things go wrong, all you have is yourself and those around you.</p> <p>When Mother Nature decides it's time to reclaim her land, you either get out of her way or sink into the torrent, never to be seen again.</p> <p>Here we go, right into the storm.</p>"; 
